OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as monkey used on
OL,4,Arestaurant's social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe use of a baby monkey in a
OL,7,Frestaurant's social media video has
OL,8,Fsparked concerns from primate
OL,9,Fcharities.
OL,11,FEastern Jam, a restaurant in
OL,12,FBirmingham's Jewellery Quarter, posted
OL,13,Fa video of a woman holding a young
OL,14,Fmarmoset called Pablo, which was
OL,15,Fcaptioned: "Even the monkey had to see
OL,16,Fwhat the hype was about."
OL,18,FWhen people on social media expressed
OL,19,Fconcern about the use of the animal in
OL,20,Fthe video, the restaurant replied that
OL,21,Fthe video was AI-generated.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
