OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as monkey used on
OL,4,Arestaurant's social media
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the restaurant later told the
OL,7,FBBC that the video was not AI-generated
OL,8,Fbut had been filmed by external social
OL,9,Fmedia company, Influencable, without
OL,10,Fmanagement's consent. Influenceable did
OL,11,Fnot respond to a request for comment.
